\"\n\n- Random variable III could *not* be modeled as a binomial distribution. The number of tickets sold for a concert cannot be interpreted as \"success\" or \"failure.\"\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I only.\""} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186411574 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186105827 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "162690db-70b3-54a8-a920-576a484a42d9" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Random Variables that Follow a Binomial Distribution" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186049632 :topic/id #uuid "06f86dee-da2a-593c-8633-10b2e3189b5c" :topic/math-academy-id 1395 :topic/title "Modeling With the Binomial Distribution"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a9dd05cc-1bdb-5141-b063-9c92310da718" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472652} {:answer/id #uuid "94f08a3f-89c0-5762-a545-859a0f138cbd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472653}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "94f08a3f-89c0-5762-a545-859a0f138cbd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472653} :answer-field/id #uuid "60b7a4a5-d299-5c0a-93b3-71d3f35b347c" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473721} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "dd9fac83-8f9c-5590-8209-b3d493c3318e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472654} {:answer/id #uuid "e620d4f1-7625-5296-b0a1-f21ce51413f8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472655}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "dd9fac83-8f9c-5590-8209-b3d493c3318e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472654} :answer-field/id #uuid "6c60bd00-8be9-5ef3-a107-4d31f9dcfa16" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473722} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7c54a1e2-357b-527c-8373-a2a29e7c08be" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472656} {:answer/id #uuid "8f6ad439-af82-5223-96a3-b2e1b7a0bf0a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472657}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "8f6ad439-af82-5223-96a3-b2e1b7a0bf0a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472657} :answer-field/id #uuid "14ef9316-2d4c-526c-baec-1f799427372f" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473723}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "e06f09da-f1cd-5f64-925a-f4c6e513e373" :question/math-academy-id "q-130361" :question/problem "Which of the following random variables could be modeled as a binomial distribution?\n- **I.** The number of trees in a forest of $300$ trees that have bird's nests\n- **II.** The number of vaccines administered in a country during one season\n- **III.** The number of odd numbers obtained when rolling an eight-sided die $10$ times\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "A binomial distribution models the number of successes in a sequence of $n$ independent experiments (where each outcome is either success or failure).\n\nWith that in mind, let's consider each of the given random variables.\n\n- Random variable I could be modeled as a binomial distribution. The number of trees that have bird's nests among $300$ trees can be interpreted as the number of successes in a sequence of $300$ independent experiments.\n\n- Random variable II could *not* be modeled as a binomial distribution. Although receiving a vaccine can be interpreted as a \"success,\" there is not a fixed number of trials in this experiment.\n\n- Random variable III could be modeled as a binomial distribution. The number of odd numbers obtained when rolling an eight-sided die $10$ times can be interpreted as the number of successes in a sequence of $10$ independent experiments.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and III only.\""} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186411616 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186124615 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "f4f2f4f4-af4a-597d-b6c6-afb82e708fc2" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Steady-State Vectors of Stochastic Matrices" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186048393 :topic/id #uuid "9babae1d-ca0d-5438-a2e4-a65dbba9f7ef" :topic/math-academy-id 1913 :topic/title "Steady-State Vectors"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "16370931-5fc9-5536-9fd7-45afe61a10b3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472688} {:answer/id #uuid "8ab6d543-ae19-5030-b18a-58051110b60a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472689}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "8ab6d543-ae19-5030-b18a-58051110b60a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472689} :answer-field/id #uuid "9b4b12e7-31db-52dd-a206-759d60508923" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473739} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "71dd4b86-fcee-58b2-a783-19a83e01d1dd" :answer/type 