that apply." :question/worked-solution "We have $-7\\in [a]_{5}$ if \n\n$$\n-7≡a\\,(\\text{mod}\\,5).\n$$\n\nLet's now consider each of the given equivalence classes.\n\n- $-7\\in [-2]_{5}$ because $-7≡-2\\,(\\text{mod}\\,5)$ $\\,✓$\n\n- $-7\\in [3]_{5}$ because $-7≡3\\,(\\text{mod}\\,5)$ $\\,✓$\n\n- $-7\\notin [7]_{5}$ because $-7≢7\\,(\\text{mod}\\,5)$ $\\,\\times $\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and II only\"."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186412969 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186152098 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "9c1fe7ea-d91e-5440-b756-37a460a18f19" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Residue Classes Containing a Given Element" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050597 :topic/id #uuid "574a92ea-12bd-55d4-a248-945298d922a1" :topic/math-academy-id 2655 :topic/title "Residue Classes"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ae60c195-21e9-5ae1-92f7-1e5f3813ef6f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473488} {:answer/id #uuid "bf1df473-22d8-5abb-89b7-12cbf1df767c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473489}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "bf1df473-22d8-5abb-89b7-12cbf1df767c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473489} :answer-field/id #uuid "ab618ccf-a765-5c7f-94ce-d51d99fe94b6" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474139} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "06dc3f58-70d7-5726-b74b-86164a0850c7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473490} {:answer/id #uuid "3ca87396-fcb0-57b8-ad5b-6c86b94dd21e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answe